---
/**
 * Landing (index.astro only): the forgetting problem, drawn as three chat
 * windows in one week. The same explanation typed Monday, Wednesday, and
 * Friday, the first two wiped when their session closed. Static markup plus
 * one blinking caret, no island. The caret animation dies under
 * prefers-reduced-motion via the global kill rule in global.css.
 */
---

<div
  class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3"
  role="img"
  aria-label="Three chat windows across one week. Monday and Wednesday: the same explanation about Boris and the cutover, both wiped when the chat closed. Friday: typing it all again."
>
  {/* Monday - explained, then wiped */}
  <div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface/60">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-line/70 px-4 py-2.5">
      <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
      <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
      <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
      <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-faint">Monday</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-1 space-y-2.5 px-4 py-4 font-mono text-[12px] leading-relaxed opacity-40">
      <p><span class="font-semibold text-green">You:</span> <span class="text-ink-soft">So: Boris owns the cutover, target is mid-July.</span></p>
      <div class="h-1.5 w-4/5 rounded bg-ink-faint/30"></div>
      <div class="h-1.5 w-3/5 rounded bg-ink-faint/30"></div>
      <p><span class="font-semibold text-teal">assistant:</span> <span class="text-ink-soft">Got it.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line/70 px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-[10.5px] text-ink-faint">
      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#f3796f]/80"></span>
      chat closed · memory wiped
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Wednesday - explained again, wiped again */}
  <div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface/60">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-line/70 px-4 py-2.5">
      <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
      <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
      <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
      <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-faint">Wednesday</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-1 space-y-2.5 px-4 py-4 font-mono text-[12px] leading-relaxed opacity-40">
      <p><span class="font-semibold text-green">You:</span> <span class="text-ink-soft">Again: Boris owns the cutover, target is mid-July.</span></p>
      <div class="h-1.5 w-3/4 rounded bg-ink-faint/30"></div>
      <div class="h-1.5 w-1/2 rounded bg-ink-faint/30"></div>
      <p><span class="font-semibold text-teal">assistant:</span> <span class="text-ink-soft">Got it.</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line/70 px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-[10.5px] text-ink-faint">
      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#f3796f]/80"></span>
      chat closed · memory wiped
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Friday - typing it all again, right now */}
  <div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface/60">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-line/70 px-4 py-2.5">
      <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
      <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
      <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
      <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-faint">Friday</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-1 space-y-2.5 px-4 py-4 font-mono text-[12px] leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        <span class="font-semibold text-green">You:</span>
        <span class="text-ink"> One more time: Boris owns the cu</span><span class="caret" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line/70 px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-[10.5px] text-ink-faint">
      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#e6b65f]/80"></span>
      explaining it again
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<p class="mt-5 text-center font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint">the same explanation, three times in one week</p>

<style>
  .caret {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0.55ch;
    height: 1.05em;
    margin-left: 2px;
    transform: translateY(0.18em);
    background: var(--color-green-bright);
    animation: caretBlink 1.1s steps(1) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes caretBlink {
    50% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
